{"4591830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Under Exposed", "steam_appid": 4591830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Under Exposed, there are no timers of stressful objectives. Only you and your camera. Take on the roll of a journalist working to discover the lost secrets of this newly reopened nature reserve, after Vanguard Power went bankrupt. Inside the nature reserve you find cozy spots and are given the task to write pieces for your newspaper. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Explore 4 small densely handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera: Adjust your cameras aperture, focus distance and length for the perfect shot. Buy new gear for more opportunities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editing: Edit your photos for the perfect look, some basic settings are implemented with more to come in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam workshop integration: Easily upload your images to the steam workshop inside the game, view other peoples best shots, be sure to send them a like!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Under Exposed, there are no timers of stressful objectives. Only you and your camera. Take on the roll of a journalist working to discover the lost secrets of this newly reopened nature reserve, after Vanguard Power went bankrupt. Inside the nature reserve you find cozy spots and are given the task to write pieces for your newspaper. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Explore 4 small densely handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera: Adjust your cameras aperture, focus distance and length for the perfect shot. Buy new gear for more opportunities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editing: Edit your photos for the perfect look, some basic settings are implemented with more to come in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam workshop integration: Easily upload your images to the steam workshop inside the game, view other peoples best shots, be sure to send them a like!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Under exposed is a cozy photography game where you take your time, explore intimate environments, chat with locals and capture your perfect shot. You can edit your photos and share your creations on the steam workshop!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591830/88046cc24e02c46dd7c20f2a7b257870530003ed/header.jpg?t=1776285250", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591830/c3ad22b45186059cb58d315a53a6cf10e4e61a32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776285250", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591830/c3ad22b45186059cb58d315a53a6cf10e4e61a32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776285250", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Pmaagnu"], "publishers": ["Pmaagnu"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "d